t — exact text in notes section 13.4 — and the PR path-B block, notes section 8; gate G-9); criterion 20's publish-size measurement (main session); criterion 21 (live gate G-7) and the UX amendment's live items (a), (b), (c), (e), (f) incl. the work-assignment ribbon export check-in (gate G-5); steps 10 and 11. Merge precondition G-0 (the 133/137/143 lines, incl. 843d62b46, land first; re-checked r3: still open). Gates: notes/task-142-assigned-field-auto-grants.md section 7.</status-note>
